#ASSERT `Do I hold my land subject to this lease` `as the owner` FALSE `an unasked fact` `an unasked fact` `an unasked number` `an unasked fact` EQUALS `does not arise for you`
#ASSERT `Do I hold my land subject to this lease` `as the buyer` FALSE `an unasked fact` `an unasked fact` `an unasked number` `an unasked fact` EQUALS `does not arise for you`

